<title>SWEDEN: SCA says to lift fine paper prices 5 pct.</title>
<headline>SCA says to lift fine paper prices 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company SCA said on Thursday it was to increase fine paper prices by five percent from February 1.</p>
<p>&quot;We estimate that this will come through in our result in March,&quot; said SCA's managing director Sverker Martin-Lof.</p>
</text>
